{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122986","id":4393229432,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBdtceA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122986","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122986.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122986.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122986","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122986/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122986/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122986/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7999c065c7f9c1b6ef27667632bf25c1770f12b2","number":122986,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"`GodotPhysics3D`: Use `LocalVector` where CoW is not needed","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSame as #122957, but for `GodotPhysics3D`.\r\n\r\nSeveral `Vector`s in `GodotPhysics3D` are never copied, making its CoW functionality unused overhead (although not that significant). Those were changed to `LocalVector`.\r\n\r\nAlso:\r\n- Replaces instances of `&my_vector[0]` with `ptr()`.\r\n- Converts a few index loops to range-based loops where appropriate.\r\n- As discussed in the other PR, remove a potential footgun (two versions of `GodotCollisionObject3D::remove_shape()` where one takes a pointer and the other takes an integer).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI consider this mostly housekeeping and should have insignificant performance improvements or regressions. `target=template_release production=yes` builds decreased by 16 KiB in size on Linux with the [official SDK](https://github.com/godotengine/buildroot/).\r\n\r\nAlthough `GodotPhysics3D` is mostly overshadowed by Jolt, at least the in-house one may be kept in order.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issue